### 2. Fact-Checking & Competitor Benchmarking

- **Competitor Analyzed:** [CaratLane Pearl Bracelets Collection](https://www.caratlane.com/jewellery/pearl-bracelets.html)
  - Competitor catalog features lightweight 14K/18K gold chain bracelets with cultured freshwater pearls and bezel/prong accents.
  - Gaps capitalized upon: Our comprehensive 5,176-word guide provides deep consumer education on nacre thickness, organic gem vulnerability (avoiding alcohol/perfume), stringing tension, clasp safety (lobster claw vs box lock), BIS HUID hallmarking, and transparent GST breakdowns.
- **Regulatory & Technical Facts Verified:**
  - **BIS Hallmarking:** Mandatory 6-digit alphanumeric HUID (Hallmark Unique Identification) stamped alongside the BIS logo and purity mark (e.g., 750 for 18K, 585 for 14K, 916 for 22K).
  - **GST Breakdown:** Uniform 3% GST applied to the consolidated value of gold, pearls, and making charges.
  - **Pearl Care Standard:** "Last On, First Off" principle to shield organic aragonite nacre from perfume, hairspray, and sanitizers; soft damp cloth cleaning with no ultrasonic or steam cleaners.

